{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120865","id":3980881920,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7tR3AA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120865","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120865.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120865.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120865","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120865/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120865/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120865/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/75644fe157f108297eeb4c36c1ca98447f8186bc","number":120865,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix editor margins with modern theme and low spacing","user":{"login":"Kapparoti","id":145791332,"node_id":"U_kgDOCLCZZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145791332?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti","html_url":"https://github.com/Kapparoti","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kapparoti/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Continuation of #120737\r\n\r\nFixes the editor settings shortcuts and the main docks.\r\nIt also aims to fix other wrong margins that i'm currently searching.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n#### Renaming:\r\nI used names similar to already-present theme type variations, but i think that removing the repetitive \"Horizontal\" from every name, making it implicit, would be better.\r\nIn this way, only \"Bottom\" would have to be specified, to make names less verbose, more clear and reusable.\r\n\r\n#### EditorSettingsDialog:\r\nWith spacing=0, the editor settings clip on the right and bottom sides. To avoid this, should a MarginContainer be added between the container and the SectionedInspector?\r\n\r\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"45\" alt=\"EditorSettings1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2b401bd-0f7b-428c-a452-39fb7c2a76f8\" /> <img width=\"455\" height=\"45\" alt=\"EditorSettings2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c3265ac-fc25-4d79-b7ae-4cf9fa9e1f65\" />\r\n\r\n#### SceneTreeDock :\r\nI also found that the SceneTreeDock vertical scroll is always detached from the border, while the horizontal one detaches as spacing increases. In other docks, such as the FileSystem, this overlapping is not present. Is this intended?\r\n\r\n<img width=\"303\" height=\"208\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b14a629f-207f-4374-9ae6-aff500174bef\" /> <img width=\"311\" height=\"189\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67e0c3ff-2636-4370-8e3d-820eca4faa5f\" />","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived